            "answer": "Priyuja's wholesale store at D 47/195, Luxa Rd, opp. PDR Mall, Ramapura, Varanasi supplies pure handloom Banarasi silk sarees at wholesale rates to boutiques and resellers. First order MOQ is 15 pieces (mix and match), with GST invoice and 24-hour dispatch pan-India."
