          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the custom-colour service and how does it work?",
            "answer": "You pick any shade from our colour chart (or send us a Pantone code, fabric swatch, or photo). We then weave your chosen design in that exact colour on handlooms in Varanasi. A minimum quantity per shade applies — message us on WhatsApp for the current requirement and lead time."
